As Saturday dawned over the vast Atlantic, the Lindbergh plane is unreported since passing Newfoundland early last night.

322
00:24:34,560 --> 00:24:36,040
Socially, it made a big difference.

323
00:24:36,500 --> 00:24:44,680
Somebody who was a farmer in Kansas could be knowing the same things that somebody on Wall Street was hearing.

324
00:24:44,820 --> 00:24:50,820
Each year the quality of radio programming improved and the number of shows multiplied.

325
00:24:50,821 --> 00:24:58,820
Performers and personalities heretofore unknown to a wide public found themselves thrust into the national spotlight overnight.

326
00:24:58,821 --> 00:25:12,820
Names like Milton Cross, Harold Arlen, Ed Wynn, Guy Lombardo and his Royal Canadians, Gertrude Berg and Will Rogers became familiar in households all over the country.

